Hi,

since february '97 I'm writing a new text-editor.
Maybe you have choosen to use emacs (or some other OS ;-)
- - I didn't like it!
Coming from 'joe' (as I think, a really good editor!),
I desided to write my own editor, because of the absents of
some usefull features (like coloring) and because it runs
in text-mode.
Some of the features of my editor are:
- - project handling
- - macros (unlimited)
- - Revision Control System (interfacing)
- - Compile (make - interfacing) with error colorisation
- - Undo/Redo (unlimited)
- - nearly all usefull features of a good text-editor
- - etc.
That's not all, but it gets more!
The documentation is a little rare, because its under
