LIV - The Linux Incoming Viewer is now available again. If you don't know what 
LIV is then it shows you the contents of SunSITE's /pub/Linux/Incoming directory, 
but with a little extra - it shows the age of files (in days) the size (Kb) and 
description.  The description is taken from the .LSM file. 

All this information is now presented in a table, instead of the older text-only 
listings. 24 hours/7 day/14 day and 28 day listings are provided. Please note 
however, when files are moved from Incoming the program can't find them so they 
will not be present in the listings. However, you can use the following URL to 
find lists of files that have recently been moved:

http://sunsite.unc.edu/pub/Linux/NEW.html

To use the LIV program, you should use the following URL:

http://sunsite.unc.edu/paulc/liv

Hyperlinks to 7, 14, and 28 day lists are available from that location. 

If you find this service useful, consider sending a email to 
paulc@sunsite.unc.edu with any suggestions you may have.



